category: X11
requires: cygwin libbz2_1 libcairo2 libcfitsio10 libfftw3_3 libgcc1 libgdk_pixbuf2.0_0 libglib2.0_0 libgomp1 libgtk3_0 libgwyddion3.12 libhdf5hl_320 libhdf5_320 libilmbase2_5_25 libIlmImf2_5_26 libintl8 libpango1.0_0 libpng16 libstdc++6 libwebp7 libxml2_2 libzip5 libzstd1 zlib0
sdesc: "Modular program for SPM (scanning probe microscopy) data visualization and analysis (utilities)"
ldesc: "Gwyddion is a modular program for SPM (scanning probe microscopy) data
visualization and analysis. Primarily it is intended for the analysis of
height fields obtained by scanning probe microscopy techniques (AFM, MFM, STM,
SNOM/NSOM) and it supports a lot of SPM data formats. However, it can be used
for general height field and (greyscale) image processing, for instance for
the analysis of profilometry data or thickness maps from imaging
spectrophotometry."

